 "text": "Skip to Main Content\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205\n\nAbout Us\nContact\nFAQ's\nYour Trip\nTravel Info\nBlog\nNight Time Game Drives\n\nBeneath the vast African night sky, the darkness unveils a hidden world of shy and elusive nocturnal creatures.\n\n \n\nA night safari drive is an exhilarating experience, offering a fresh and thrilling perspective on wildlife viewing. As daylight fades, your heightened senses tune into the mysterious sounds and movements of the night, guided by the sweep of your guide's powerful spotlight across the bush in search of reflective eyes.\n\n​\n\nSpotting Africa's nocturnal animals, like lions, leopards, hyenas, wild dogs, and other less-seen nocturnal species, is a rare treat. These creatures come alive in the cooler night conditions, and seeing their eyes glow under the red-filtered spotlight offers a starkly different and eerie experience compared to daytime safaris.\n\n​\n\nDuring the drive, you might spot owls, nightjars, chameleons, and bush babies in their natural habitats, sometimes catching the quiet drama of an owl capturing its prey. The absence of light pollution allows the stars of the East African sky to shine brightly, with your guide pointing out constellations and galaxies, adding an educational layer to your adventure.\n\nA safari night drive is not just an outing; it’s an immersive journey into the nocturnal heart of the wilderness, making it a must-experience activity for anyone visiting the region.\n\nLeopard in the Spot Light\n\n1/9\nHave a unique adventure in mind? Let’s help you plan\nENQUIRE NOW\nWidget Didn’t Load\nCheck your internet and refresh this page.\nIf that doesn’t work, contact us.\nRefresh this page\nContact us\n\ninfo@mazingirasafari.com\n\nuk.sales@mazingirasafari.com\n\n+255784278205 / +255767278204\n\nAccessibility Statement \n\nMazingira Eco Friendly Safari Adventure\n\nArusha \n\nP.O Box 12544\n\nStay informed, join our newsletter\n\nEnter your email here \nSubscribe\n\nMazingira Safari © 2023 | ",
